      "side": 1,
      "message": "This series in and of itself doesn\u0027t affect the ABI as extracted by STG.\n\nHowever, to test properly:\n\n1. LLVM prebuilts need to include the necessary profile generation tools.\n2. The option needs to be turned on in `defconfig`.\n3. Kleaf needs to know about the profile input (so it knows there is a build dependency) and it needs to pass it as `CLANG_AUTOFDO_PROFILE` to Kbuild.\n4. We need an ARM64 device that runs `android15-6.6` and a suitable load test\n5. We need profile gathering instructions for ARM64.\n6. We need to conduct multiple builds using the same profile (but with different build host / path).\n7. We need to compare build artefacts.\n8. We need to check that building GKI with this / vendor modules without this and vice versa results in viable mixed builds.\n\nIs really a good idea to target `android15-6.6` at this point?",
